{"articleNo":"228286","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=228286&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] < 2019 구미아시아연극제> 공연 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.08.21","hit":"8825","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img width=\"773\" height=\"1020\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"width: 773px; height: 1020px; clear: none; float: none;\" src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBgjAnA9CAcUEcDGBRA9kgdgDQELYEEB1bATUwHEiAPASwGEBbAOgAdMBzIA%20\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span>&gt;&gt; &lt;2019 구미아시아연극제&gt;의 극장공연 중 초대공연인</span><strong> <span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">가족음악극 \"이솝우화\"</span> </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">가 <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">금오공과대학교 대강당</span></strong></span>에서 올려집니다. </span></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 아울러 앞서 마임공연의 진수인 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">\"고재경의 마임쇼\"</span></strong></span>가&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><strong>미니야외공연장(북카페 앞)</strong></span>에서 공연되니 관심있으신&nbsp;분들의 많은&nbsp;관람 부탁드립니다.&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><br></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&gt;&gt; 공연 정보</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">가족음악극<strong> \"이솝우화\"</strong></span>&nbsp;(극단 : 공상집단 뚱딴지)&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 일시 :<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\"><strong> 2019. 9. 4.(수) 19:30~&nbsp;&nbsp; (60분)&nbsp;</strong></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 장소 : <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">금오공과대학교 본관 대강당</span></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 대상 : </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>재학생, 대학구성원, 지역민 누구나</strong></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">전석 초대(무료)</span></strong></span><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">로 진행되며, </span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\">티켓은 당일 현장에서 배부</span><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">됩니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 6세 이상 관람가능하며, 6세이상 어린이는 부모님과 동반입장하여 관람 가능합니다. </span></font></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><br></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 찾아가는공연 <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><strong>\"고재경의 마임쇼\"</strong></span> (공연 : 마임이스트 고재경)</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 일시 : <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><strong>2019. 9. 4.(수) 18:00~&nbsp; (30분)</strong></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 장소 : <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">미니야외공연장(북카페 앞)</span></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong> - 대상 : <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><strong>재학생, 대학구성원, 지역민 누구나</strong></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><strong>무료로 진행</strong></span>되며, 현장에서&nbsp;관람 가능합니다<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">. </span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br></p></span></span></strong></span></span><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><br></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"><br></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
